msgstr "Iibso oo iibi mareegaha, domaynada iyo meelaha xiriirinta la dhisay, iyadoo lacagta si ammaan ah loo hayo ilaa labada dhinac ay ka qanacayaan."

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-promo.php:429
msgid "Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living"
msgstr "Zinn Hub® — kireyso dadkan u shaqaysta xirfad ahaan"

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-promo.php:430
msgid "Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid."
msgstr "Suuqa kala iibsiga ee caalamiga ah: ka baadh in ka badan 10,000 adeeg oo diyaar ah oo ka yimid qoraayaasha, naqshadeeyayaasha, horumariyayaasha iyo khuburada SEO, ama soo dhig mashruuc oo u oggolow inay dalabkooda soo gudbiyaan."
